  "match": "fair",
  "gaps": "Transept window is a three-lancet row, not one huge traceried arch under a recessed stone arch; stone has little course contrast; no flying arches, nave wall plain and shorter than the photo's; porch arches are simple, balcony tracery is a plain parapet; camera shows whole church rather than the close photo view."
